   "subject": "Re: [brms-users] Eight schools example using brms",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Go for coef(&lt;brmsmodel&gt;)$J to extract the summary estimates of theta and \r\ncoef(&lt;brmsmodel&gt;, summary = FALSE)$J to extract the posterior samples themselves.\r\n\r\n<br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2018-02-18 9:41 GMT+01:00  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mri...@stanford.edu</a>&gt;</span>:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
